      "raw": "<p>\"<em>My</em>&nbsp;last name starts with a B!\" is perhaps the most hilarious moment of unscripted comedy I have ever experienced, and I just about died laughing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What do you wanna bet it's Kid Kosmic with a K? Maybe even Kosmik. And the Kosmik Kuff.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For my part, I think I prefer Writer's Rooms these days. Getting to see C&amp;A's creative process a few times was really fun, but I think letting them focus on telling us the stories instead of trying to create them live ends with a better podcast.</p>",
