      "id": 229189,
      "name": "Sea-Envy",
      "username": "Sea-Envy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-11-13T16:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would love to see Writer's Room for Neo-Fighters season 1</p>\n<p>Adam could do the art for the collector's set DVD box art</p>\n<p>Getting a Blue Beatle III (Jaimie Reyes) feeling from Kid Kosmic and the Kosmic Kuff</p>\n<p>I figure Ben (Kid Kosmic) had a normal friend who was a hero fan boy. As a fan surogate POV character he would need to learn things about heroing that he would not ask Young Legacy or Unity. Also i figure his friend thinks Ben is dateing both Felicia and Devra, or at least that they are chaseing him and he is being dumb for avoiding them.- \"Dude i saw them drag you into the broom closet and you were in there for at least 1/2 an hour\"</p>\n<p>I would love to see Kid Cosmic added to RPG continuity as another student at Freedom Accademy just as Debbie was brought into continuity as Devra (Unity) earlier. My character Salamander is set up as leader of another team with undefined members and i would really want Ben as part of his team. With Legacy and Unity not in his peer group Aaron could definatly be the \"come on, it's what you do!\" inspiration/motivation/bad influence</p>\n<p>And yes Christopher suddenly remembering his own name starts with \"B\" will be my vote for funniest episode</p>\n<p>Honestly i would not mind a short episode where they talk about food for real and not dumb characters</p>\n<p>eddited 3 times now&nbsp; i was tired when i typed</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
