      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-11-15T20:34:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I bet Kid Cosmic was in Daybreak, first as a cameo, then as a recurring side joke character.</p>\n<p>While Guise wouldn't have been in Neo-Fighters, maybe Wager Master was?&nbsp; I can see there being a thing where Wager Master is hiding somewhere in a single scene of each episode (anyone remember classic&nbsp;She-Ra?).</p>\n<p>Also, I humbly suggest the Prime Wardens movie be called Dark World instead of World of Darkness.&nbsp; It echoes both Dark Mind and Nightmare World.&nbsp; Plus, in the metaverse, White Wolf's World of Darkness probably exists but Thor: The Dark World wouldn't.</p>",
